# Morrowind Daedric quests: Sheogorath's Fork of Horripilation (DA_Sheogorath). Sheogorath's statue in Ihinipalit
# speaks three lines and sets the quest (10), enabling the giant bull netch. The mad hermit Big Head greets the
# player (30), talks of the netch (40) and of the Fork (50), which lies in his shack. The netch slain while the Fork is
# equipped logs 60 (da_forkScript); the statue trades the Fork for the Spear of Bitter Mercy (70).
# PositionCell and Position stand in for the travel, EquipItem for the player equipping the Fork, the console kill
# for the deathblow. FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05: 0545CECC Sheogorath's statue, 05657C3A the Fork,
# 0530BFEA its base, 05671DE0 the giant bull netch.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_da_azura_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case da_sheogorath_start
run
player->PositionCell 68 650 -484 0 "Ihinipalit, Shrine"
wait 120
activate 0545CECC
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Sheogorath == 10
end

case da_sheogorath_hermit
run
player->PositionCell 0 -40 37 0 "Big Head's Shack"
until 600 "big head"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk big head
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Sheogorath == 30
ask giant bull netch
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Sheogorath == 40
ask Fork of Horripilation
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Sheogorath == 50
bye
take 05657C3A
until 120 player->GetItemCount fork_horripilation_unique >= 1
end

case da_sheogorath_netch
run
console player.equipitem 0530BFEA
player->Position 10621 200300 379 0
until 600 "netch_giant_unique"->GetDistance player < 2000
wait 30
console 05671DE0.kill
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Sheogorath == 60
end

case da_sheogorath_done
run
player->PositionCell 68 650 -484 0 "Ihinipalit, Shrine"
wait 120
activate 0545CECC
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Sheogorath == 70
expect player->GetItemCount spear_mercy_unique == 1
end
